inl cross_cutting_segment () : migration_segment = MigrationSegment ("cross-cutting", 11u32, 11u32, "fresh instrumented public smoke source-topology proxy-search owner shards deterministic LCOV union portable Rust lowering repairs ZIP-only bootstrap seed recovery atomic self-install canonical-entry recovery strict regular-read verification bundle-lifecycle verification product-diff archive-Deflate process-observation streaming-input observation and lower eoie-process stdin-channel verification migrated from embedded Rust tests to package-only Spiral probes satisfy the Spiral-only settlement standard; the cross-cutting segment is settled")
